1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:02,939
- Oh, every night
- Oh, every night

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:07,285
- Hold tight
- Hold tight

3
00:00:08,073 --> 00:00:09,823
SHELDON:
Baby, hold tight

4
00:00:09,992 --> 00:00:11,492
[IN UNISON]
Any way you want it

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,950
That's the way you need it
Any way you want it

6
00:00:15,122 --> 00:00:16,912
Oh, whoa

7
00:00:20,002 --> 00:00:21,422
(Leonard:)All right, Mother.

8
00:00:21,587 --> 00:00:25,587
(Leonard:)- Um, have a nice flight.
- That's not really in my control, is it?

9
00:00:27,092 --> 00:00:28,972
(Beverley:)Oh, uh, yes.

10
00:00:38,896 --> 00:00:41,106
- Oh, good morning.
- Morning.

11
00:00:41,273 --> 00:00:44,773
(Penny:)- I was just coming over to talk to you...
- You don't have to.

12
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:46,483
(Leonard's Mother:)Ever.

13
00:00:46,945 --> 00:00:48,615
(Penny:)Gotcha.

14
00:00:49,323 --> 00:00:50,993
- Goodbye, Mother.
- Goodbye, Leonard.

15
00:00:51,158 --> 00:00:54,618
(Beverley:)So, slugger, shall we pick up
where we left off last time?

16
00:00:55,621 --> 00:00:56,621
[PENNY SOBBING]

17
00:00:56,788 --> 00:01:02,048
(Penny(in tears):)I mean, my mom could've just said,
"Bob, get over it, she's a girl, move on."

18
00:01:02,461 --> 00:01:04,341
(Penny(in tears):)But she didn't. Not one word.

19
00:01:04,504 --> 00:01:07,424
(Beverley:)Interesting. Would you be willing
to fly to New Jersey...

20
00:01:07,591 --> 00:01:11,641
(Beverley:)...and discuss your relationship
with your parents during a brain scan?

21
00:01:13,138 --> 00:01:15,978
- Would it help?
- Well, it would help me.

